<div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-8"><h1 class="h2">Application draft</h1><p>Profile-controlled details are shown on review. <a href="<?=e(url('/profile/edit'))?>">Edit your profile</a> when needed.</p><form method="post" action="<?=e(url('/membership/application/save'))?>" class="card shadow-sm"><div class="card-body p-4"><?=csrf_field()?><label class="form-label" for="membership_type_id">Membership type</label><select class="form-select" id="membership_type_id" name="membership_type_id" required><option value="">Select membership type</option><?php foreach($membershipTypes as $type):?><option value="<?=e($type['id'])?>" <?=($application['membership_type_id']??$profile['membership_type_id']??'')==$type['id']?'selected':''?>><?=e($type['name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select><p class="form-text">Fee to be confirmed. Zero values are placeholders.</p><div class="alert alert-info mt-4">Documents are not required at submission; collection and verification are deferred.</div></div><div class="card-footer bg-white p-4 d-flex justify-content-between"><a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="<?=e(url('/membership/application'))?>">Cancel</a><button class="btn btn-primary">Save and review draft</button></div></form></div></div>
